# Build artifacts and scratch. Everything here is reproducible from the tracked
# scripts -- see RUNBOOK.md for the rebuild order.

# Compiled IOR/mdtest install prefix. Rebuild: ./build_ior.sh
opt/

# Upstream IOR checkout. This is its own git clone; committing it would create a
# broken nested repo. Re-fetch: git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/hpc/ior.git src/ior
src/

# Slurm job output, rewritten on every run.
logs/

# mdtest scratch target. run_mdtest.sbatch wipes it after each job; it must not
# carry state between runs.
mdtest_home/

# Compiled MPI smoke-test binary. The source (hello.c) IS tracked.
hello_bin
hello_c1
*.o

# Benchmark results ARE tracked on purpose -- results/*.txt and
# results/comparison.json are the evidence behind RESULTS.md, including
# results/archive_contaminated/, which documents the discarded first attempt.
# report.html is generated by build_report.py but tracked so the report can be
# read without running anything.

# Credentials are already blocked repo-wide by the root .gitignore
# (id_*, *.pem, *.key, conn.auth) -- those patterns match at any depth.
